<title>UK: Ellis &amp; Everard to buy Mozel for 13 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Ellis &amp; Everard to buy Mozel for 13 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British chemicals and polymers manufacturer Ellis &amp; Everard said on Monday it was buying Mozel Inc, a U.S. speciality chemicals company for 13.1 million stg.  </p>
<p>Mozel is based in St Louis and is expected to add 20 percent to the company's sales in the U.S.</p>
<p>In 1996 Mozel reported sales of 62 million stg and pre-tax profits to 1.3 million.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
